# Protobuf & gRPC. Dead config in vitruvian-core today (no first-party .proto;
# the only protos/grpc are node_modules/maven transitives) — declared to match
# the kitchen-sink so adding a .proto later Just Works and the divergence stays
# closed. `--@protobuf//bazel/toolchains:prefer_prebuilt_protoc` (.bazelrc)
# avoids building protoc from source. rules_foreign_cc is floored at 0.15.1:
# protobuf pulls it transitively and the default (0.10.1) loads the Bazel-9-
